WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.080 --> 00:00:03.720
Let's look at some of the different ways

00:00:03.720 --> 00:00:07.320
that we can add video to this page.

00:00:07.320 --> 00:00:09.680
First, I'm going to hit edit.

00:00:09.680 --> 00:00:11.240
So, the first way that I can add video

00:00:11.240 --> 00:00:14.400
to the page is I can go to the blocks.

00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:17.000
Search for video.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:19.320
Which I can find under media.

00:00:19.320 --> 00:00:23.720
And then I can click to add the video.

00:00:23.720 --> 00:00:25.440
From there, I just update the source if

00:00:25.440 --> 00:00:27.240
I have a different YouTube video that I

00:00:27.240 --> 00:00:29.640
want to put in there.

00:00:29.640 --> 00:00:32.840
And then hit save.

00:00:32.840 --> 00:00:34.080
But, there's a couple other ways that we

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:36.280
can add videos to the page.

00:00:36.280 --> 00:00:37.800
So, I hit edit.

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:41.480
And I have that YouTube link already.

00:00:41.480 --> 00:00:44.560
I can just paste on an individual line

00:00:44.560 --> 00:00:47.400
and then it hacks will detect that this

00:00:47.400 --> 00:00:49.000
is a YouTube link in this case and

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:53.320
automatically give me the video.

00:00:53.320 --> 00:00:55.640
I could also use the slash command. So,

00:00:55.640 --> 00:00:58.040
I could type video and insert one this

00:00:58.040 --> 00:00:59.600
way.

00:00:59.600 --> 00:01:03.360
Updating that URL.

00:01:03.360 --> 00:01:07.080
Adding a title in the title field.

00:01:07.080 --> 00:01:10.160
I can change the poster image.

00:01:10.160 --> 00:01:11.800
If I wanted to make it a cool picture of

00:01:11.800 --> 00:01:14.320
me.

00:01:14.320 --> 00:01:17.240
We can modify spacing and under advanced

00:01:17.240 --> 00:01:20.280
we start to get into text tracks. Uh

00:01:20.280 --> 00:01:21.240
whether it should start at the

00:01:21.240 --> 00:01:23.720
beginning, an audio descriptive track

00:01:23.720 --> 00:01:26.720
and more.

00:01:26.720 --> 00:01:30.040
I can also, uniquely to videos, I can

00:01:30.040 --> 00:01:32.840
take a video and if I drag it on top of

00:01:32.840 --> 00:01:35.760
another video, it'll automatically build

00:01:35.760 --> 00:01:38.080
a video playlist.

00:01:38.080 --> 00:01:39.320
So, these are some of the different ways

00:01:39.320 --> 00:01:41.640
that you can add video to the site. You

00:01:41.640 --> 00:01:44.040
could always use blocks and if you have

00:01:44.040 --> 00:01:46.520
video locally, you could upload a video

00:01:46.520 --> 00:01:48.960
or use the in-context screen recorder,

00:01:48.960 --> 00:01:51.080
though it will generate very large

00:01:51.080 --> 00:01:53.080
files.
